appfolio-appf-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"APPF 2019 Q1","e":"appf","d":"2019-05-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Robert Randall","x":"We believe this innovation will transform customers' businesses, improve processes and streamline investors' experiences.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/appfolio-inc-appf-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"APPF 2019 Q2","e":"appf","d":"2019-07-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ida K. Kane","x":"…real estate property manager customers; AppFolio Investment Management, which serves real estate investment managers; LISA AppFolio's AI Leasing Assistant which we developed from the technology acquired through the Dynasty acquisition and is now offered as a value plus service to our real estate","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/29/appfolio-inc-appf-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"APPF 2019 Q3","e":"appf","d":"2019-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Randall","x":"AppFolio's AI leasing assistant Lisa, which is built on technology acquired in the Dynasty acquisition earlier this year, automates the leasing experience by leveraging conversational AI to schedule appointments, streamline communication and deliver performance insights.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/28/appfolio-inc-appf-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"APPF 2019 Q3","e":"appf","d":"2019-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Randall","x":"With enhancements to board member tracking and management we enable community association managers to further streamline their processes and boost efficiencies by providing additional automation and enhanced board communication for our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/28/appfolio-inc-appf-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"APPF 2019 Q3","e":"appf","d":"2019-10-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ida Kane","x":"Given our performance in the quarter, we are raising our outlook for the full year 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/28/appfolio-inc-appf-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"APPF 2019 Q4","e":"appf","d":"2020-03-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Randall","x":"…our investment in serving larger community association managers with improvements to features, such as Board member tracking and management and enable community association managers to further streamline their processes and boost efficiencies through automation and enhanced Board communication.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/03/appfolio-inc-appf-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"APPF 2019 Q4","e":"appf","d":"2020-03-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Randall","x":"AppFolio Investment Management empowers real estate investment managers with a modern solution to better serve their investors by streamlining fundraising, reporting and communication.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/03/appfolio-inc-appf-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"APPF 2020 Q2","e":"appf","d":"2020-08-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Randall","x":"For our customers managing community association portfolios, we remain focused on areas that streamline efficiency and help them better serve their homeowners and board members.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/03/appfolio-inc-appf-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"APPF 2020 Q4","e":"appf","d":"2021-03-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ida Kane","x":"We continue to focus on growing our customer and user base and expanding their adoption and utilization of Value+ services, which are designed to enhance, automate and streamline processes and workflows that are essential to our customers' businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/02/appfolio-inc-appf-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"APPF 2020 Q4","e":"appf","d":"2021-03-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Randall","x":"We also continue to expand our offering for community association managers, focusing on streamlining efficiency and helping them better serve their homeowners and board members.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/02/appfolio-inc-appf-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"APPF 2021 Q1","e":"appf","d":"2021-05-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ida Kane","x":"We continue to focus on growing our customer user base and expanding their adoption and utilization of Value+ services, which are designed to enhance, automate, and streamline processes and workflows that are essential to our customers businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/11/appfolio-inc-appf-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"APPF 2021 Q1","e":"appf","d":"2021-05-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Randall","x":"In the first quarter, we partnered with NetVendor, streamline vendor compliance tracking for APM Plus customers, thereby minimizing risk and providing them with a single system of record.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/11/appfolio-inc-appf-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"APPF 2021 Q3","e":"appf","d":"2021-11-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Randall","x":"…loan tracking and accounting automation, enabling customers to begin tracking to take loans and mortgages within AppFolio Property Manager to further streamline accounting processes, thereby saving time and making it easier for property owners to assess and optimize their debt financing strategy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/09/appfolio-inc-appf-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"APPF 2021 Q3","e":"appf","d":"2021-11-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jason Randall","x":"This includes streamlinin